<style is:inline>.why-hero .hero-grid{padding-top:50px!important;padding-bottom:50px!important}@media(max-width:640px){.why-hero .hero-grid{padding-top:48px!important;padding-bottom:48px!important}}</style>
<section class="why-hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">WHY ZKTECO WFM</div><h1>We Do Not Assemble the Solution.<br/><span>We Control It.</span></h1><p class="lead">Specialized workforce data collection technology—from product design and engineering through manufacturing, software, integration and support.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="contact.html">Talk to an Expert</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#control">See How We Control It</a></div><div class="hero-note">One technology organization behind the complete collection lifecycle.</div></div><div class="control-visual"><img src="assets/Control_why_wfm.png" alt="ZKTeco WFM technology control lifecycle"/></div></div></section>
<div class="proof-strip"><div class="wrap proof-grid" aria-label="ZKTeco WFM technology lifecycle"><article class="proof-stage"><div class="proof-stage-icon"><img src="assets/design-k.svg" alt=""/></div><h2>WE DESIGN IT.</h2></article><article class="proof-stage"><div class="proof-stage-icon"><img src="assets/Engineering-k.svg" alt=""/></div><h2>WE ENGINEER IT.</h2></article><article class="proof-stage"><div class="proof-stage-icon"><img src="assets/Manufacturing.svg" alt=""/></div><h2>WE MANUFACTURE IT.</h2></article><article class="proof-stage"><div class="proof-stage-icon"><img src="assets/support-icon-k.svg" alt=""/></div><h2>WE SUPPORT IT.</h2></article></div></div>
<section id="specialized"><div class="wrap special-grid"><div class="special-copy"><div class="eyebrow">SPECIALIZED BY DESIGN</div><h2>Workforce Data Collection Is What We Are Built to Do.</h2><p>We capture <strong>trusted workforce data</strong> at the source and connect it to the systems that run your business.</p><p><strong>It's our focus. It's our expertise. It's what we do.</strong></p></div><div class="source-diagram"><img src="assets/why wfm_image_3.png" alt="Employee interaction captured as trusted workforce data and connected to an enterprise platform"/></div></div></section>
<section class="control-model" id="control"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">THE ZKTECO WFM DIFFERENCE</div><h2>One Company. One Complete Technology Lifecycle.</h2><p>Design, engineering, manufacturing, connectivity, integration and support—connected under one technology organization.</p></div><div class="control-band"><div class="control-steps"><article class="control-step"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 18l5-5 3 3 7-8"/><path d="M15 8h4v4"/></svg></div><div class="step-num">01</div><h3>Design</h3><p>Built around workforce needs.</p></article><article class="control-step"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M8 4h8l4 4v8l-4 4H8l-4-4V8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></div><div class="step-num">02</div><h3>Engineer</h3><p>Hardware and software together.</p></article><article class="control-step"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 9l8-5 8 5-8 5z"/><path d="M4 14l8 5 8-5"/></svg></div><div class="step-num">03</div><h3>Manufacture</h3><p>Scale, quality and supply control.</p></article><article class="control-step"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="7" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="17" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M10 12h4"/></svg></div><div class="step-num">04</div><h3>Connect</h3><p>Devices, apps and cloud working together.</p></article><article class="control-step"><div class="step-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M5 7h7v10H5zM12 12h7"/><path d="M16 9l3 3-3 3"/></svg></div><div class="step-num">05</div><h3>Integrate</h3><p>Connected to Workday and WFM/HCM platforms.</p></article><article class="control-step"><div class="step-icon"><img src="assets/support-icon-k.svg" alt=""/></div><div class="step-num">06</div><h3>Support</h3><p>One accountable technology partner.</p></article></div><div class="control-payoff"><div class="payoff">Greater Control</div><div class="payoff">Better Continuity</div><div class="payoff">Clearer Accountability</div></div></div><div class="control-close">One company. One coordinated roadmap. Fewer handoffs.</div></div></section>
<section class="manufacturing" id="manufacturing"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">GLOBAL MANUFACTURING ADVANTAGE</div><h2>Manufacturing Scale Matters.</h2><p>The scale of our manufacturing operations helps deliver advantages in cost, quality, availability, and product evolution that are difficult to replicate.</p></div><div class="mfg-layout"><div class="mfg-wheel"><div class="mfg-ring"><div class="mfg-core">GLOBAL<br/>SCALE</div><div class="mfg-dot d1">COST EFFICIENCY</div><div class="mfg-dot d2">QUALITY CONTROL</div><div class="mfg-dot d3">ROADMAP CONTINUITY</div><div class="mfg-dot d4">SUPPLY CONTROL</div></div></div><div class="mfg-values"><article class="mfg-card"><div class="k">CONTROL OVER COST</div><h3>Fewer Layers</h3><p>Scale can reduce layers between product creation and delivery.</p><div class="mfg-value">More cost-effective enterprise technology.</div></article><article class="mfg-card"><div class="k">CONTROL OVER QUALITY</div><h3>Common Requirements</h3><p>Engineering, production and testing can follow one product direction.</p><div class="mfg-value">Technology built for its intended environment.</div></article><article class="mfg-card"><div class="k">CONTROL OVER SUPPLY</div><h3>Greater Visibility</h3><p>Closer access to sourcing and production supports planning and availability.</p><div class="mfg-value">A stronger foundation for availability.</div></article><article class="mfg-card"><div class="k">CONTROL OVER ROADMAP</div><h3>Built to Evolve</h3><p>Hardware, software and cloud requirements can evolve together.</p><div class="mfg-value">Greater continuity across product generations.</div></article></div></div><div class="mfg-close"><strong>Design control + engineering depth + manufacturing scale</strong> = a stronger workforce data collection lifecycle.</div></div></section><section class="workday-proof" id="proof"><div class="wrap"><div class="proof-shell"><div class="proof-top"><div class="eyebrow">A TRACK RECORD THAT MATTERS</div><h2>Built for Workday. Trusted at Scale.</h2><p>Since 2014, our Workday partnership and experience supporting hundreds of customers have continued to shape how we collect time and labor data today.</p></div><div class="scale-grid"><div class="scale-item"><strong>SINCE 2014</strong><span>Workday partner</span></div><div class="scale-item"><strong>HUNDREDS</strong><span>Workday customers</span></div><div class="scale-item"><strong>TENS OF THOUSANDS</strong><span>Cloud locations</span></div><div class="scale-item"><strong>MILLIONS</strong><span>Employees supported</span></div></div><div class="proof-close">Deep Workday Experience. Better Economics. Long-Term Confidence.</div></div></div></section>


<section class="brand-close"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">THE WORKFORCE DATA COLLECTION COMPANY</div><h2>Trusted Time &amp; Labor Data Collection Starts Here.</h2><p>Payroll, labor, compliance and operations all depend on what happens at the point of collection.</p><div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn primary" href="/?openZohoForm=1#contact">Let's Talk</a></div></div></section>
